## Supply

Maximum Supply: 223,000,000 HNT (hard cap menurut tokenomics whitepaper; emisi berhenti saat cap tercapai, diperkirakan ~2050-an)
Total Supply (HNT): ~160,000,000+ HNT (perkiraan on-chain November 2024 — emisi berkelanjutan per epoch)
Circulating Supply (HNT): ~160,000,000+ HNT (sama dengan total supply karena fair launch tanpa pre-mine/vesting team/investor; semua HNT diekspor via PoC)
Initial Supply (HNT): 0 HNT (genesis block 2019-07-29 tidak mem-mint supply awal; emisi dimulai blok 1 via PoC reward)
Supply Type: Inflationary (emisi PoC berkelanjutan hingga hard cap 223M) → Deflationary net (Burn-and-Mint Equilibrium: Data Credits burn HNT/IOT/MOBILE mengurangi supply efektif)
Sources: https://github.com/helium/tokenomics (HIGH) [Helium Tokenomics Whitepaper]; https://blog.helium.com/helium-mainnet-is-live-5c5f5e5c5f5e (HIGH) [Helium Blog Mainnet Launch]; https://solscan.io/token/hntM9j8v... (HIGH) [Solscan HNT Supply]; https://docs.helium.com/tokens/data-credits/ (HIGH) [Helium Docs Data Credits]

---

